6.</em></p><p><strong>The Lake County county recorder records Indiana deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in Lake County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://lakecountyin.gov/departments/recorder' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Lake County Recorder</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Lake County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Lake County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>What we could not confirm</h2><ul><li>Lake assessor details and county appeal deadline not found</li><li>Lake due dates/penalties not read on county page (state DLGF: May 11 and Nov 10 2026)</li></ul><h2>Lake County by the numbers</h2><p>Lake County has about 498,990 residents and 216,330 housing units in the Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey, number 2 by population among the 38 in counties we cover. The median owner-occupied home is worth $214,700, 5% above the median of the in counties covered. Median household income is $68,985, against $70,330 for the middle in county. Owners live in 71% of occupied homes and renters in 29%. The median home was built in 1968, about 55 years ago.</p><div class=